## 5. Spacing, Shape, and Touch Targets

- Base spacing unit: 8px. Use 8, 16, 24, 32, 48.
- **Patient tap targets: minimum 64px height, 12px minimum gap.** Primary buttons span full width on mobile.
- **Professional tap targets: minimum 44px.**
- Card radius 20px (patient) / 12px (professional). Button radius 16px.
- Cards: 1px `--border`, soft shadow `0 2px 8px rgba(30,42,36,0.08)`.
- Maximum content width: 720px (patient), 1280px (professional).
- Breakpoints: mobile under 640px, tablet 640 to 1024px, desktop above 1024px.

