## 12. Games

| Game | What the patient does | Cognitive area | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| Memory match | Flip pairs of regional objects | Memory | Start with 4 pairs, max 8 |
| Sound and picture recognition | Hear a sound, pick the matching picture | Recognition | 3 picture choices, large |
| Routine recall | "What do we do after tea?" pick the next step | Recall | Uses the patient's own routine where possible |
| Pattern completion | Pick the missing piece in a simple sequence | Attention | Colors plus shapes, never colors alone |

**Regional objects and sounds (illustrations, not photos):** tea cup and kettle, bamboo basket (*dola*), gamosa, *japi* hat, loom, banana leaf, betel nut and leaf, boat on a river, hornbill, one-horned rhino, pineapple, orange, conch shell, drum, flute, rain, river, birdsong, temple or church bell, market sounds.

**Difficulty:** levels 1 to 5, adjusted automatically in the mock logic, capped by the Healthcare Worker's "difficulty ceiling". Show the level only in professional views.

