## 14. Rules for Lovable

1. Build only what the current prompt asks for. Do not change other pages.
2. Use the tokens in this file. Do not invent new colors, fonts, or spacing.
3. Keep patient and professional components separate so patient rules (big, quiet, no dialogs) are never mixed with dashboard patterns.
4. All text goes through a simple translation helper so languages can be switched later.
5. Mock data only. No backend calls, no real login, no secrets.
6. Every new screen must include its loading, empty, error, and mobile layouts.
7. After each build, list what was added and anything assumed.

